breached-passwords.txt.gz (P04, MASTER_PLAN 7.1 "breached-password check against a bundled top-100k list")

Source: SecLists, Passwords/Common-Credentials/100k-most-used-passwords-NCSC.txt (UK NCSC top 100,000 passwords
from Have I Been Pwned), https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists - MIT License, Copyright (c) 2018 Daniel Miessler.
Processing: trimmed, lower-cased, de-duplicated, sorted; only entries of 10+ characters are kept, because shorter
passwords are already refused by PasswordPolicy.MIN. Matching is case-insensitive.
